## Example 6: Complex DELETE - Remove Entire Product Family with Cascades

**PM provides:**
```
User request: "Delete the entire PET Jars family - we're discontinuing this product line"
My search: product_families "PET Jars" → Found (id: abc-123-jar-family-uuid) with 3 products
```

**Your workflow:**
